# macOS / iCloud sync duplicates — ".next 2/", "opencv 2.js", "README 2.md".
# Always junk copies, never real files. Hero portraits with spaces are safe:
# these patterns need a literal " 2" at the end of the name or before the
# extension, which "Soldier 76.png" and "Junker Queen.png" do not have.
* 2
* 2.*

